(* Pia.Llm.Tokenizer (ADR 0067, M2): every goal is proved, with nothing
   accepted unproved. load checks a llama2.c tokenizer.bin and indexes its
   pieces; encode runs run.c's BPE and every id it gives is below the
   vocabulary size; decode writes each token's bytes; and round_trip shows
   that decoding what encode gave brings the text back, byte for byte.
